# From "Messages From Beyond" (Wave VII - Voyager, CD3-6): connecting with a
# departed loved one on a familiar beach. The source has no explicit Focus
# count -- filed at F27 for the shared "loved ones, way station" theme with
# place-of-your-own.gws, though the tape itself never says so.

@segment  messages-from-beyond
@title    Messages From Beyond
@levels   F27
@duration ~3m

say You hear the ocean now. Birds overhead. The surf, gently leaving the shore.
pause 8
say You're standing on a warm, sunny beach -- somewhere familiar to you. Feel the sand under your feet. The sun's warmth. A gentle wind on your face.
pause 10
say Relax into it.
pause 5
say Now feel a hand reaching for yours. You're moving higher, your awareness expanding, more and more.
pause 8
say Your loved ones are with you now. Their essence is woven into you, and always will be. The separation between you was only physical. Nothing more.
pause 10
say The one you wish to connect with is here with you now.
pause 6
say You'll see a ray of light -- pure, bright white, warm and pleasant, coming down from above. Feel it touch you.
pause 8
say Ask now, for a message. Something that matters to you.
pause 10
say And if you wish, send one back.
hold 30
say It's time to return. Express your love as you turn away, and let what you've received stay with you clearly.
pause 8
say Feel yourself moving back down, toward the sea. The waves at your feet again. The soft breeze.
pause 8
say Remember the message. And when you can, send them one of love in return.
pause 8
